   "type": "file",
   "name": "e2_adamson.py",
   "filePath": "projects/perturb-seq-eval/src/perturb_eval/experiments/e2_adamson.py",
   "summary": "Real-data E2 grid-cell trainer for Adamson 2016 Perturb-seq: reads .h5ad files with h5py, log1p-normalises and selects HVGs, builds a leave-one-perturbation-out split, trains the chosen backbone and reports held-out MSD as a GridCellResult.",
